   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1,000eb (Very Expensive)<br>\n<strong>Enhances:</strong> Sandevistan<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> 0 (Cyberware Enhancement)</p>\n<p>Sandevistan Operating System. The Sandevistan triggers on half of a ROF 2 Action and runs 12 seconds (4 Rounds). The usual +3 initiative still applies, and while it is up each of these costs only half of a ROF 2 Action, none of them twice in a Turn: Reload, Get Up, Equip or Drop Shield, Stabilize on yourself, and stowing a weapon, clearing a jam, putting yourself out while On Fire, activating an item or a piece of cyberware. When it drops, the next hour is cooldown unless the user pays 2 Humanity per consecutive activation inside it (2, then 4, then 6).</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Every Operating System is incompatible with every other Operating System and with the base cyberware it is for: none of them can be installed while another OS, or that OS's own base cyberware, is anywhere in the user's body or in a worn apparatus they're connected to. The sheet doesn't enforce that.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Operating Systems &gt; Sandevistan Operating Systems).</em></p>"
